change has already happened.

00:11:09.825 --> 00:11:11.934
That's why the pushback is so severe.

00:11:11.934 --> 00:11:12.905
- I know, but also,

00:11:12.905 --> 00:11:15.396
I don't find it aggressive
to just stand up

00:11:15.396 --> 00:11:16.802
for something so simplistic

00:11:16.802 --> 00:11:17.635
- [Billy] It's not!

00:11:17.635 --> 00:11:19.115
- as just being able to be you.

00:11:19.115 --> 00:11:19.948
- [Billy] It's not.

00:11:19.948 --> 00:11:20.781
- That's not aggressive for me.

00:11:20.781 --> 00:11:23.625
- And that's a silencing
mechanism from the other side.

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:25.014
I see it all the time.

00:11:25.014 --> 00:11:29.097
Whether they use the buzz
word of politicization.

00:11:30.033 --> 00:11:32.086
Well, yes, of course it's politicized!

00:11:32.086 --> 00:11:33.595
You're trying to take my rights away!

00:11:33.595 --> 00:11:34.428
- Yeah.

00:11:34.428 --> 00:11:35.942
- Yes, it's political!

00:11:35.942 --> 00:11:38.275
You're trying to silence me.

00:11:38.275 --> 00:11:39.108
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:11:39.108 --> 00:11:41.505
- And that is not going
to happen in the arts.

00:11:41.505 --> 00:11:43.265
You know, when I,
because I'm a writer too.

00:11:43.265 --> 00:11:44.098
- Yeah.

00:11:44.098 --> 00:11:46.010
- So another birth buzzword for me is,

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.760
oh, it's too preachy.

00:11:49.086 --> 00:11:50.934
Somebody needs to be preached to.

00:11:50.934 --> 00:11:51.915
- [Kelly] Yeah I was gonna say,

00:11:51.915 --> 00:11:53.736
- Because the world is a mess!

00:11:53.736 --> 00:11:56.145
- Yeah. We're not killing it.

00:11:56.145 --> 00:11:58.001
We're not killing it.

00:11:58.001 --> 00:11:59.425
But you know what's so funny? I'm gonna,

00:11:59.425 --> 00:12:00.574
- Y'all just want me to shut up.

00:12:00.574 --> 00:12:01.923
I'm gonna come right, I'm gonna come-

00:12:01.923 --> 00:12:03.294
Well, I understand that well too,

00:12:03.294 --> 00:12:05.098
'cause I'm a woman, but like, but, but

00:12:05.098 --> 00:12:05.931
- Exactly.

00:12:05.931 --> 00:12:07.709
- Yeah. I love that.

00:12:07.709 --> 00:12:09.791
But I love that it comes
full circle though.

00:12:09.791 --> 00:12:11.593
Like you said, the
preaching wasn't for you.

00:12:11.593 --> 00:12:13.651
